  storyText: "The Uplink\n\nA rusted dish the size of a house, half buried in sand. Ines wires you in. On the horizon - the lights of Arasaka AVs.\n\nTeo: \"They tracked you. We'll hold them. Go!\"\n\n1. Jack in now.\n2. Help the nomads fight first."
